---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import CtaStrip from '../../components/CtaStrip.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Algorithmic Accountability Services for Boards & CFOs | Lozen Advisory" description="Advisory services for boards, CFOs, and risk leaders addressing AI accountability, investment decisions, human attribution, and workforce materiality.">
<section class="page-hero">
  <div class="grid-bg"></div>
  <div class="wrap inner">
    <div class="crumb"><a href="/">Home</a> &nbsp;/&nbsp; Services</div>
    <span class="pill">Board &amp; Governance Advisory</span>
    <h1>AI Governance Advisory <span class="hl">Services</span></h1>
    <p class="sub">Five engagements, one governing question: who is accountable when the AI gets it wrong, and can the organization prove it? Explore the service built for your seat at the table.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section id="services">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="bento">
      <a href="/services/board-ai-governance-advisory/" class="card span3 feat reveal"><div class="ic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"/><path d="M3 12h18M12 3a14 14 0 0 1 0 18M12 3a14 14 0 0 0 0 18"/></svg></div><h3>Board AI Governance Advisory</h3><p>Governance built for quarterly meetings is now overseeing AI risk that moves daily. Ongoing counsel for boards closing the gap between awareness and readiness.</p><span class="go">Learn more →</span></a>
      <a href="/services/cfo-ai-investment-advisory/" class="card span3 reveal"><div class="ic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><line x1="18" y1="20" x2="18" y2="10"/><line x1="12" y1="20" x2="12" y2="4"/><line x1="6" y1="20" x2="6" y2="14"/></svg></div><h3>CFO AI Investment Advisory</h3><p>Everyone pressuring you to spend on AI has a stake in the answer. Independent counsel for the CFO deciding what to fund, defend, or kill — tied to no vendor and no adoption agenda.</p><span class="go">Learn more →</span></a>
      <a href="/services/board-ai-algorithmic-accountability/" class="card span2 reveal"><div class="ic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 9v4M12 17h.01M10.29 3.86 1.82 18a2 2 0 0 0 1.71 3h16.94a2 2 0 0 0 1.71-3L13.71 3.86a2 2 0 0 0-3.42 0z"/></svg></div><h3>Algorithmic Accountability Risk</h3><p>When an AI agent finds a route no one authorized, "the AI went rogue" is the story that lets everyone off the hook. We reconstruct who approved, who could refuse, and who priced the risk.</p><span class="go">Learn more →</span></a>
      <a href="/services/board-ai-name-standard-advisory/" class="card span2 reveal"><div class="ic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M14 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V8z"/><polyline points="14 2 14 8 20 8"/><line x1="16" y1="13" x2="8" y2="13"/><line x1="16" y1="17" x2="8" y2="17"/></svg></div><h3>Name Standard℠ Advisory</h3><p>The AI did the work; a human signed it. The Name Standard℠ tests whether that sign-off was real accountability — or ceremony that won't survive scrutiny.</p><span class="go">Learn more →</span></a>
      <a href="/services/ai-workforce-materiality/" class="card span2 reveal"><div class="ic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M17 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H5a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2"/><circle cx="9" cy="7" r="4"/><path d="M23 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-3-3.87"/><path d="M16 3.13a4 4 0 0 1 0 7.75"/></svg></div><h3>AI Workforce Materiality</h3><p>Stop measuring software adoption. Start governing human-capital exposure — a 90-minute paid briefing for boards, CFOs, GCs, and CHROs.</p><span class="go">Learn more →</span></a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="band">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="center section-head">
      <h2 class="h2">Strategic counsel for the era of algorithmic accountability.</h2>
      <p class="lead">The absence of data is not the absence of risk.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="prose" style="max-width:760px;margin:0 auto">
      <ul>
        <li>Your AI governance framework may exist. Your evidence of who was accountable may not.</li>
        <li>Caremark oversight, D&amp;O exposure, and insurance underwriting now ask the same question — and expect an answer before an incident forces it.</li>
        <li>The <a href="/services/board-ai-name-standard-advisory/">Name Standard℠</a> tests whether that answer would actually hold up.</li>
        <li>The same failure shows up in workforce risk — retention, succession, benefits utilization — under the same governance logic, in a different domain.</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<CtaStrip
  title="Not sure which service fits?"
  description="Tell us the governance question your board, CFO, or risk function is facing, and we'll point you to the right engagement — or scope something new."
  primaryHref="/request-briefing/"
  primaryLabel="Request a Briefing →"
  secondaryHref="/contact/"
  secondaryLabel="Contact Us"
/>
</BaseLayout>
